{"id":"vod_bf_32233","vodId":"32233","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"四叠半神话大系","name_cn":"四叠半神话大系","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-33/3e60616642e2d3fc41a78da3031e9146.jpg"},"summary":"故事以主角的第一人称进行，“我”（浅沼晋太郎 配音）是京都大学的一名三年级生，原本期待着有一个玫瑰色多姿多彩的大学生活，希望自己能交上飘逸黑长发的漂亮女朋友。然而事与愿违，主人公经历了一场失败的恋爱，身边的朋友也少得可怜。主人公唯一的朋友小津（吉野裕行 配音），长相像一只妖怪，以捉弄情侣为乐。主人公常常唾弃小津，却离不开他。随后主人公认识了师妹明石（坂本真绫 配音），她是个性格冷淡的黑发少女。　　正是因为自己当初选择了网球部，才导致大学两年如此失败，于是“我”假想如果自己入学时选择了另外一个社团，会不会经历另外一种截然不同的大学生活呢？本作从平行时空的角度，围绕着主人公重新从大一新生选择社团开始，选择了各种各样不同社团，发展出不一样的青春故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 08:21:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/sidiebanshenhuadaxi/第11集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:11.921Z"}